Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Should Fail"
}

###

### ❌ 400 — invalid id
PATCH {{host}}/lists/not-a-uuid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Should Fail"
}

###

### 🔒 401 — no token
PATCH {{host}}/lists/{{createListNameOnly.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

