POST {{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Remove Item Test — Item {{$guid}}",
  "categoryId": "{{removeItemSetupCategory.response.body.id}}"
}

###

### setup — a list to attach it to
# @name removeItemSetupList
POST {{host}}/lists
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Remove Item Test — List {{$guid}}"
}

###

### setup — attach the item to the list
POST {{host}}/lists/{{removeItemSetupList.response.body.id}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "itemId": "{{removeItemSetupItem.response.body.id}}"
}

###

### ❌ 404 — item not on this list (wrong item id)
DELETE {{host}}/lists/{{removeItemSetupList.response.body.id}}/items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ❌ 404 — list does not exist
DELETE {{host}}/lists/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/{{removeItemSetupItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ❌ 400 — invalid itemId
DELETE {{host}}/lists/{{removeItemSetupList.response.body.id}}/items/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ❌ 400 — invalid list id
DELETE {{host}}/lists/not-a-uuid/items/{{removeItemSetupItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 🔒 401 — no token
