###

### 🔒 401 — no token
POST {{host}}/lists/{{packAllSetupList.response.body.id}}/pack-all

###

### cleanup — archive this section's list
DELETE {{host}}/lists/{{packAllSetupList.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### cleanup — delete this section's items
DELETE {{host}}/items/{{packAllSetupItemA.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

DELETE {{host}}/items/{{packAllSetupItemB.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### cleanup — delete this section's category
DELETE {{host}}/categories/{{packAllSetupCategory.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  Cleanup
# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#
#  DELETE /lists/:id now exists (PACK-011), but it only archives — there's no
#  hard-delete, so lists created in this file stay in the DB (archived).
#  Archive the remaining two lists here so ItemIsInUse (which only counts
#  non-archived list references) stops blocking the item/category deletes
#  below — both createListFromTemplate (seeded from the template) and
#  createListWithEventDate (PACK-012's POST /lists/:id/items section added
#  createItem to it directly) now reference createItem via
#  packing_list_items, so both need archiving before it's free to delete.

### 204 — archive createListWithEventDate
DELETE {{host}}/lists/{{createListWithEventDate.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 204 — archive createListFromTemplate
DELETE {{host}}/lists/{{createListFromTemplate.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 204 — remove the item from the template (clears the template_items reference)
DELETE {{host}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 204 — delete the template
DELETE {{host}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ✅ 204 — item can now be deleted: its only list reference (createListFromTemplate)
#          is archived, and archived lists don't count for ItemIsInUse
DELETE {{host}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ✅ 204 — category can now be deleted too
DELETE {{host}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
